taking criticism, show-off. Also note lack of reliability evidence for C.\n\nThus we can say we now recommend Candidate A, because reliability and crew cooperation are more critical and are documented, while C's technical strengths are offset by lack of reliability and feedback concerns.\n\nThus metadata JSON vote Candidate A.\n\nProceed."}
